    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tower Green has been thoughtfully designed as a welcoming neighbourhood of spacious 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes which offer generous light-filled accommodation, designed to maximise light and space to the highest specification with comfortable living spaces, contemporary kitchen, generous bedrooms and luxurious bathrooms, surrounded by landscaped open spaces and wide pathways that foster community spirit. Each home combines intelligent layouts with modern finishes, blending energy efficiency, comfort and enduring style to create a premium living environment.\r\n\r\nAt Tower Green, interiors are shaped for modern living, with spaces that work beautifully day to day. Open-plan kitchens form the hub of each home, with streamlined cabinetry, quality appliances, and generous workspace for cooking, dining and gathering. Bathrooms are finished with modern tiling and fittings for a fresh, timeless look. Bedrooms are spacious and light-filled, with well-planned layouts and practical storage. \r\n\r\nEvery detail is considered for comfort, durability, and style, creating homes that feel effortless to live in and easy to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThese stunning 3-bedroom homes offer a spacious 121 sq. m / 1,302 sq. ft of living space, these A2-rated homes combine modern design with superior energy efficiency, ideal for today’s family lifestyle.  The open-plan kitchen/living area is perfect for family meals and social gatherings, with a separate utility room for added storage and convenience. \r\n\r\nFor more information or to register your interest visit www.towergreen.com"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Perfectly positioned for modern living, Newbridge offers exceptional connectivity. The town lies only 25 minutes from the M50 via the M7 motorway, with frequent bus and rail services providing direct access to Dublin City Centre, Grand Canal Dock and Heuston Station. Locally, a thriving sporting culture offers everything from GAA, rugby and soccer to golf, equestrian pursuits and world-class racing at The Curragh, Naas and Punchestown.\r\n\r\nSchools\r\nNewbridge is home to a wide range of educational institutions including Newbridge College, Holy Family Secondary School, Patrician Secondary School, St. Conleth’s Community College, Scoil Mhuire Junior & Senior Schools, Gaelscoil Chill Dara, Newbridge Educate Together NS, St. Conleth & Mary’s NS, St. Patrick’s NS, St. Mark’s Special School, and Leinster Senior College.\r\n\r\nPublic Transport\r\nTower Green benefits from excellent transport links. Direct trains to Dublin Heuston take just 27 minutes. Bus 126 and other services connect to Dublin City and Airport. The M7 and M50 motorways provide fast access by car."
      }
    ],
